# This directory is kept locally for development and comparison purposes
# It contains alternative implementations of OFX parsers (forks from asgrim's version)
# but should not be committed to the repository.
# 
# Current implementations in this directory:
# - jacques-ofxparser (original asgrim fork)
# - memhetcoban-ofxparser (community fork)
# - ofx2 (alternative implementation)
# - ofx4 (alternative implementation)
# - ksf_ofxparser (our implementation - local reference copy)
#
# These are used for reference and capability comparison during development.
